  hints:
  - "The way north is blocked by two gates. The first gate has no plate here \u2014 something else must open it."
  - "Dani can pull the lever to open the first gate. Then Scarlet can push the boulder through it onto the plate beyond, which opens the second gate."
  - "First switch to Dani and pull the lever. Then switch to Scarlet and push the boulder north through the open gate onto the stone plate. Then bring both siblings to the glowing circle."
